", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822034_1163443652496605_4437736750532399358_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qN_v3kWaZ38Q7kNvwGiCJbs&_nc_oc=Adp8t-oyHlITzqjs00XiBc6SyMbCl5yqtr6yR6_dW4p43kfHU8Ms8ahiWgD2tmRDUqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH63N4boExd23gf9Ngk07sy2oUs_BJrp844YAINAMx4jQ&oe=6A8D8E03"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "724629803656108", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303198_724629806989441_9037091471697535725_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1fMDJjDSqkEQ7kNvwELU323&_nc_oc=AdqzIk-FvN_EoknWIEzMQZie-xroU0QQ9TKiGUjtdxnU_QwjFhCCsE5htGKfjajW9lQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGkFkRkrealpFYDSPxd5C_OHlpOkbUtE0b5HG04bVinQg&oe=6A8D7CCE"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "555738367475449", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303672_555738370808782_4745762157325174194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4zireEHfutsQ7kNvwH1igxC&_nc_oc=Adr9JBjx7PHWtzlTLcSR0hGpeu8NR7ExdpQyF3OuRsfR0uacMSCcbt-Nj03atfnkN7I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFnosAyhUejOvQZibZL2JUTe5IXEdu5ro2S3dOzkn3l1A&oe=6A8D7C6B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "AphX", "keywords": ["chimp", "monke", "physics", "sandbox", "physix"], "long_description": "Inspired by Chemp Physics by XORWIRE Games, and Bonelab by Stress Level Zero, Aphx is a physics based gorilla-tag style movement game which you can build stuff, or just mess around. \n\nUse the AphX Tablet to control the entire game!\nJust from the AphX Tablet alone, you can:\n- Select items to spawn\n- Adjust color\n- Adjust cosmetics\n- Adjust movement style\n- Get help\n- Go through a tutorial\n\nAnd more to come!\n\nThank you XORWIRE Games for making this possible.", "short_description": "Inspired by Chemp Physics by XORWIRE Games, and Bonelab by Stress Level Z